{
  "slug": "xiao",
  "name": "Xiao",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Control a Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20+ (model xiaomi.vacuum.c102gl) via the xiao CLI. Full vacuum control — start, stop, pause, dock, find, room cleaning, zone cleaning, base-station (mop wash/dry, dust collect, tray eject), consumable tracking, and settings (fan speed, water level, DND window). Agent-ready: ships with AGENTS.md, llms.txt, --json output on read commands, and canonical exit codes (2 = not configured, 77 = auth failed) for autonomous error recovery.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `xiao` (Control a Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20+ (model xiaomi.vacuum.c102gl) through the `xiao` CLI).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install xiao@claude-community` from `dacrypt/xiao`.\n\nCLI + web dashboard to control a Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X20+ (model: `xiaomi.vacuum.c102gl`) via the Xiaomi Cloud API.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
